                        {
                          "id": "bio-p3-r1",
                          "text": "In a proposed pilot, the role would help define a narrow workflow, identify the systems and owners involved, and document assumptions before solution choices are made. It would coordinate review of access, retention, control and exception-handling requirements with designated client stakeholders.",
