                      "space_before_pt": 0,
                      "space_after_pt": 0,
                      "runs": [
                        {
                          "id": "bio-p3-r2",
                          "text": "The team would then prepare a reviewable set of process maps, decision records, interface questions and acceptance criteria. Scope and sequencing would be confirmed after discovery; this illustrative profile makes no claim about delivered work or business impact.",
